#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:1
msgid "无人机应用 - PX4"
msgstr "UAV Integration - PX4"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **D20** 接入 PX4，并通过 QGroundControl 验证定位输出。常规使用无人机版固件，通过 GPS 串口默认输出 **10 "
"Hz UBX** 定位数据。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the **D20** to PX4 and verify positioning in QGroundControl. The "
"standard UAV firmware outputs **10 Hz UBX** over the GPS serial port."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:9
msgid ""
"根据现场条件选择 4G 或 LoRa 差分链路。固件选择见[固件与输出协议选择](../operation/firmware-"
"output.md)，完整 Pin 定义见[D20 接口与接线](../operation/d20-wiring.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a 4G or LoRa correction link for the site. See [Selecting Firmware"
" and Output Protocol](../operation/firmware-output.md) and [D20 "
"Interfaces and Wiring](../operation/d20-wiring.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:11
msgid "硬件连接"
msgstr "Hardware connection"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:14
msgid ""
"先核对 D20 8-pin 线束，再连接飞控电源 保持设备和飞控断电，并按[完整 8-pin "
"定义](../operation/d20-wiring.md)逐线核对。D20 供电为 5 V ±0.5 V，UART/PPS I/O 为 3.3"
" V；反接电源或把 5 V 接入信号线可能损坏设备。"
msgstr ""
"Check the D20 8-pin harness before connecting flight-controller power. "
"Keep both devices powered off and verify every wire against the [complete"
" 8-pin pinout](../operation/d20-wiring.md). Supply 5 V ±0.5 V; UART/PPS "
"I/O is 3.3 V. Reversed supply polarity or 5 V on a signal pin may damage "
"the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:17
msgid "D20 5V接 PX4飞控GPS接口 5V。"
msgstr "Connect D20 5V to the PX4 flight controller GPS port 5V pin."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:18
msgid "D20 TX 接 PX4飞控GPS接口 RX。"
msgstr "Connect D20 TX to the PX4 flight controller GPS port RX pin."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:19
msgid "D20 RX 接 PX4飞控GPS接口 TX。"
msgstr "Connect D20 RX to the PX4 flight controller GPS port TX pin."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:20
msgid "D20 GND 接 PX4飞控GPS接口 GND。"
msgstr "Connect D20 GND to the PX4 flight controller GPS port GND pin."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:22
msgid "下图以PX4固件的CUAV 7-Nano的GPS1接口的接线为例："
msgstr ""
"The following diagram shows example wiring for the GPS1 port on a CUAV "
"7-Nano running PX4 firmware:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:24
msgid "![D20 接入 CUAV 7-Nano GPS 接口示意图](../images/ardupilot-serial.png)"
msgstr "![D20 wiring to the CUAV 7-Nano GPS port](../images/ardupilot-serial.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:24
msgid "D20 接入 CUAV 7-Nano GPS 接口示意图"
msgstr "D20 wiring to the CUAV 7-Nano GPS port"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:26
msgid ""
"若飞控提供明确 Pin 定义的标准 6-pin GPS/UART 接口，可以使用配套的 D20 8-pin 转飞控 6-pin "
"转接线。连接前必须同时核对转接线两端 Pin 顺序、D20 8-pin 定义和飞控接口定义；接口外形匹配不代表线序一定匹配。"
msgstr ""
"If the flight controller has a clearly defined standard 6-pin GPS/UART "
"port, use the supplied D20 8-pin-to-6-pin adapter cable. Before "
"connecting, verify the pin order at both ends, the D20 8-pin pinout, and "
"the flight-controller port definition. Matching connector shapes do not "
"guarantee matching pin assignments."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:28
msgid "参数配置"
msgstr "Parameter Configuration"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:30
msgid ""
"以下参数用于说明常见 PX4 配置项。不同 PX4 版本和飞控硬件可能采用不同参数名称或端口编号，应以实际固件和 QGroundControl "
"显示为准。"
msgstr ""
"The following parameters are used to illustrate common PX4 configuration "
"options. Different PX4 versions and flight control hardware may use "
"different parameter names or port numbers, and the actual firmware and "
"QGroundControl display should prevail."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "参数名"
msgstr "Parameter Name"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "作用"
msgstr "Function"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "建议值"
msgstr "Recommended value"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`GPS_1_CONFIG`"
msgstr "`GPS_1_CONFIG`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "使能GPS1"
msgstr "Enable GPS1"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`GPS1`"
msgstr "`GPS1`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`GPS_1_PROTOCOL`"
msgstr "`GPS_1_PROTOCOL`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "设置 GPS 协议"
msgstr "Set GPS protocol"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`1`（UBX）"
msgstr "`1` (UBX)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`GPS_UBX_BAUD2`"
msgstr "`GPS_UBX_BAUD2`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "设置GPS UBX协议波特率,D20默认波特率是`115200`,应与`SER_GPS1_BAUD`的波特率配置保持一致"
msgstr ""
"Set the GPS UBX protocol baud rate. The D20 default baud rate is "
"`115200`; it must match the baud rate configured in `SER_GPS1_BAUD`."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`115200`"
msgstr "`115200`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`SER_GPS1_BAUD`"
msgstr "`SER_GPS1_BAUD`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "设置串口波特率"
msgstr "Set the serial port baud rate"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`EKF2_GPS_CTRL`"
msgstr "`EKF2_GPS_CTRL`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "设置 GPS 融合方式"
msgstr "Set GPS fusion method"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "保持默认值：`7`"
msgstr "Keep the default value: `7`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`EKF2_GPS_POS_X/Y/Z`"
msgstr "`EKF2_GPS_POS_X/Y/Z`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "设置天线相对机体的安装偏移，一般情况也可保持默认没有偏移"
msgstr ""
"Set the antenna installation offset relative to the vehicle body; in most"
" cases, the default zero offset is sufficient."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "实测值"
msgstr "Measured value"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:42
msgid "QGroundControl 中找到GPS的配置并使能GPS1： ![alt text](../images/image-parame.png)"
msgstr ""
"In QGroundControl, find the GPS settings and enable GPS1: "
"![Screenshot](../images/image-parame.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:42
#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:45
#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:47
#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:50
#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:53
#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:55
msgid "alt text"
msgstr "Screenshot"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:45
msgid "![alt text](../images/image-set-gps1.png)"
msgstr "![Screenshot](../images/image-set-gps1.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:47
msgid ""
"设置成GPS1之后QGroundControl 会提示需要重启生效，按如下步骤执行一次飞控重启： ![alt text](../images"
"/image-reboot.png)"
msgstr ""
"After selecting GPS1, QGroundControl prompts you to restart for the "
"change to take effect. Restart the flight controller once as follows: "
"![Screenshot](../images/image-reboot.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:50
msgid ""
"飞控完成重启之后重新进入到`Vehicle "
"Configuration`的`Parameters`参数列表中，找到GPS相关的配置这里就有完整的飞控GPS的配置了，D20想要正确接入飞控按照以下的配置来填写，主要的配置涉及`GPS`、`EKF2`、`Serial`:"
" ![alt text](../images/image-gps1-params-setting.png)"
msgstr ""
"After the flight controller restarts, return to the `Parameters` list "
"under `Vehicle Configuration`. Find the GPS-related settings to view the "
"complete flight-controller GPS configuration. To connect D20 correctly, "
"enter the settings below; the main groups are `GPS`, `EKF2`, and "
"`Serial`: ![Screenshot](../images/image-gps1-params-setting.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:53
msgid "![alt text](../images/image-gps1_baud.png)"
msgstr "![Screenshot](../images/image-gps1_baud.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:55
msgid ""
"`EKF2_GPS_CTRL`飞控一般就是默认值`7`,检查一下参数即可 ![alt text](../images/image-ekf2"
"-gps-ctrl.png)"
msgstr ""
"`EKF2_GPS_CTRL` is normally the default value `7` on the flight "
"controller; just check the parameter. ![Screenshot](../images/image-ekf2"
"-gps-ctrl.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:58
msgid "完成以上步骤之后需要再次重启飞控确保配置生效。"
msgstr ""
"Restart the flight controller again after completing these steps to "
"ensure that the settings take effect."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:60
msgid "验证"
msgstr "Verify"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:62
msgid "在 QGroundControl 中观察 GPS 状态："
msgstr "Observe GPS status in QGroundControl:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:64
msgid "PX4 持续识别 GPS，卫星数和定位数据正常更新。"
msgstr ""
"PX4 continuously recognizes the GPS and updates satellite and positioning"
" data."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:65
msgid "HDOP/VDOP 无异常。"
msgstr "HDOP/VDOP normal."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:66
msgid "开阔环境进入 RTK 固定解。"
msgstr "The receiver reaches an RTK fixed solution with an open sky view."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:68
msgid "接入完成判据"
msgstr "Integration success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:71
msgid "PX4 持续识别 GPS，并在开阔环境进入 **RTK 固定解**。"
msgstr ""
"PX4 continuously recognizes the GPS and reaches an **RTK fixed solution**"
" with an open sky view."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:74
msgid ""
"若 PX4 无法识别 D20，请先确认 D20 当前为无人机版固件，再检查飞控串口参数、UART 电平兼容性和 TX/RX 接线，并在 "
"QGroundControl 中观察 GPS 状态。"
msgstr ""
"If PX4 cannot recognize D20, first confirm that D20 is currently running "
"the UAV firmware, then check the flight controller's serial port "
"parameters, UART level compatibility, and TX/RX connections, and observe "
"the GPS status in QGroundControl."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:76
msgid ""
"有定位输出但无法进入固定解时，按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/rtk-fixed-"
"validation.md)检查差分配置和现场条件。"
msgstr ""
"If there is position output but you cannot obtain a fixed solution, check"
" the correction setup and field conditions according to [RTK Status and "
"Fixed Solution Validation](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)."

